 lang=\"zh-Hans\">海豚是非常聪明的动物</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">地平線</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちへいせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">地平线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202585\"><ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>つき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>地平線<rp>(</rp><rt>ちへいせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">月亮在地平线上方</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">地方</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちほう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">地区；地带；地方；地域；地方；农村；乡下；外省；民间社会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204987\">それは<ruby>地方<rp>(</rp><rt>ちほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のニュースに<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">当地新闻报导此事。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">地名</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">地名；地理名称</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207860\">その<ruby>地名<rp>(</rp><rt>ちめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>伝説<rp>(</rp><rt>でんせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>由来<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆらい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">传说把名字给了那个地方</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span c