g=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">褐色；浅褐色；棕色</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210959\">その<ruby>犬<rp>(</rp><rt>いぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>茶色<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゃいろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>小<rp>(</rp><rt>ちい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さくて、やせています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">狗是棕色的,小的和薄的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">茶色い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゃいろい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">浅茶色</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219883\">この<ruby>辺<rp>(</rp><rt>へん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>茶色<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゃいろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>財布<rp>(</rp><rt>さいふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ませんでしたか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你看见一个棕色的钱包了吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">着</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゃく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">到达；抵达；件；套；名；位；步；着法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110332\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はレースで１<ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他在比赛中居第一位</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">着手</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちゃくしゅ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">开始着手；着手进行；开始从事；开始；着手；着手犯罪；开始实施犯罪；落子；下棋走一步</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-